# ==========================================
# FindJob Copilot - Git Ignore Configuration
# 严防敏感信息、个人隐私与临时运行态泄露
# ==========================================

# 1. 核心敏感信息与私有环境配置 (绝对严禁提交)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.cert
*.crt
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
secrets.json
credentials.json

# 2. 本地数据库与持久化数据 (包含个人求职、面试与审计日志)
data/
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db-journal
*.sqlite3-journal

# 3. 个人简历与私有文档
*resume*.pdf
*resume*.docx
*简历*.pdf
*简历*.docx
uploads/
downloads/

